@startuml
title Daily Settlement and Room Account Deduction

participant Scheduler
participant Metering
participant Asset
participant Occupancy
participant Accounting

Scheduler -> Metering : runDailySettlement(settlementDate)
Metering -> Asset : load active room-device bindings
Metering -> Occupancy : load checked-in stays for date
Metering -> Metering : compute room daily usage
Metering -> Metering : compute room daily charge
Metering -> Metering : split charge
1) enterprise-covered part
2) tenant-apportioned part
Metering -> Accounting : deductRoomAccountForDailySettlement(plan)
Accounting -> Accounting : deduct enterprise sub-balance first
Accounting -> Accounting : deduct tenant sub-balances next
Accounting -> Accounting : record insufficient items if needed
Accounting --> Metering : deductionResult
Metering --> Scheduler : settlementCompleted
@enduml
